  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文化設計思維",
    "sub_ename": "CULTURAL DESIGN THINKING",
    "describe_ch": "文化與美學設計及結合是未來新紀元的一種趨勢。企業文化是一個企業的靈魂。美學文化可以明顯地宣示在其專業領域上的美學涵構與創新成就。透過學習美學思維及文化的設計過程是一個企業未來進行簡化和人性化的必要手段與工具，也是企業一種核心能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The combination of corporate culture and aesthetics is a trend in the new era of the future. Corporate culture is the soul of a company. Aesthetic culture can clearly declare the aesthetics and innovations in its field of expertise. The process of design thinking through the study of aesthetics is a necessary means and tool for the simplification and humanization of the enterprise in the future, and it is also a core competence of the enterprise.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
